    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired in the heat; thirsty; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lightheaded on standing; no chest pain, palpitations, or syncope</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new weakness, numbness, speech change, facial droop, diplopia, or vertigo</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Passing less urine than usual; no dysuria</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vomiting, diarrhea, or black stools</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
